Z||000001||Tina||08-12-2001||10:12 PM||||Part 2<BR> <IMG SRC="http://albums.photopoint.com/j/View?u=1315468&a=13622756&p=52842373"> <BR>FieroHoHo's red Fiero<BR>BTW Thanks for bringing a treat for us, hmmmmm   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> <BR> <IMG SRC="http://albums.photopoint.com/j/View?u=1315468&a=13622756&p=52842381"> <BR>Matt Kneen's 84 Indy with the longitudal V-8<BR>and the interesting tranny mount.<BR>(Sorry no pic of engine,only one that didn't turn out)<P> <IMG SRC="http://albums.photopoint.com/j/View?u=1315468&a=13622756&p=52842386"> <BR>O.K. ....here we go again.<BR>Is it,.... Gary Plant ? <BR>Forgive me,I've I didn't get it right.<BR>I do remember your interior light,codes display,fog light switches though.           What was the fourth switch for again?<P>Also there, Elfiero (but no green V-8,sold already.Instead he surprised us with a black Vette)<BR>Brian C.(his Black '87 V-8 isn't quite ready yet.)<BR>Thanks for writing down,who all showed up.<BR>Otherwise, I would of really be lost.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/redface.gif"><P>No shows where,Jimmy,Kev,Fropuff. <BR>What happend? Though you guys where going to come?<BR>Well and Uaana,although the 3.4 is up and running.<BR>Missed his alignment due to axle problems.<P>Oh, and there was me  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/calhoun1.jpg"> <BR>Tina with her 87 383 SBC||||reg||1
