Z||000012||Jimmy||08-14-2001||07:45 AM||||I had to choose to go to either the Saturday night get together or the cruise to Be Be lake Sunday(MFF club event).<P>Lets just say I didn't make it to Bebe Lake and I was kinda bummed about it.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif">   However, myself and the girlfriend got together with Jason Sunday.  We ended up cruising around town and had a pretty good time.<P>Just to let everyone know, I cruise down to Porky's/Midway every Friday.  Jason and I and some other non-Fiero owners like to get together beforehand and then cruise down there.  If anyone is looking to go for a drive on the weekend shoot me an email and I'll see whats going on.<P>Jim ||||reg||1
Z||000013||MinnGreenGT||08-14-2001||09:54 AM||||86SE... nice to have another MFF member!  Hope to see you around.<P>Lowfierogt... sorry to hear that.  A fuel pump shouldn't be the worst thing to have to replace- I mean Hey! you've got 280k miles on the thing.<P>ChrisWeeks... I was really glad to see that you made it Saturday.  And I'm even more glad that you showed up in your GT and had a good time.  Look forward to seeing you around more.<P>Jimmy... I usually go up to Porky's either Friday or Saturday nights.  Where do you guys meet up- and what time do you usually get together?  I've only seen one other Fiero up there all year, and it was an '84 Indy two weeks ago.<P>Can't wait to do it again. If we could possibly avoid scheduling it the same weekend as a MFF event, we might have better attendance next time.||||reg||1
